  "description": "CUBGOZ crystallizes in the triclinic crystal system with space group P -1. Reported CIF formula moiety: C180 H228 Eu8 N4 O74 S16. From the CIF bond table, Eu1 (Eu) has 7 O neighbors; Eu2 (Eu) has 8 O neighbors; Eu3 (Eu) has 9 O neighbors; Eu4 (Eu) has 9 O neighbors; Eu5 (Eu) has 7 O neighbors; Eu6 (Eu) has 8 O neighbors; Eu7 (Eu) has 9 O neighbors; Eu8 (Eu) has 9 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 8 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.738-3.869 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 93.07-115.66°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [Eu8(TC4A-SO2)4(TA)2(DMF)4(H2O)10](solvents). Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 10 H2O (explicit grouped unit in article formula).",
